desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Avoid Ssh Insecure Ignore Host Key"
	title_zh: "Avoid Ssh Insecure Ignore Host Key"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-avoid-ssh-insecure-ignore-host-key"
	risk: "certificate-validation"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Disabled host key verification detected. This allows man-in-the-middle attacks. Use the 'golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/knownhosts' package to do host key verification. See https://skarlso.github.io/2019/02/17/go-ssh-with-host-key-verification/ to learn more about the problem and how to fix it.

### 风险类型
证书校验缺失（certificate-validation）

### 影响
未正确校验 TLS 证书或关闭了证书校验，中间人攻击者可窃听或篡改通信。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-322: Key Exchange without Entity Authentication
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
启用并严格校验证书链、主机名和有效期，禁止在生产环境关闭校验。

推荐修复：
Use the 'golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/knownhosts' package to do host key verification.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.go": <<<POS
ssh.InsecureIgnoreHostKey()
POS
	"safefile://pos.go": <<<NEG
ssh.FixedHostKey
NEG
)

${*.go}.pattern_regex(/(?:ssh\.InsecureIgnoreHostKey\(\))/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Avoid Ssh Insecure Ignore Host Key",
	title_zh: "Avoid Ssh Insecure Ignore Host Key",
	message: "Avoid Ssh Insecure Ignore Host Key detected.",
}
